5. Other people's work

Some parts of the software, and some things it downloads or runs, are
other people's work under their own licenses, and those licenses
apply to them instead of this one. This license does not limit
anything their licenses allow. They include:

  - vendor/web-llm.js, a build of WebLLM (MLC AI), under the Apache
