  - programs fetched or installed when the relay or run server is set
    up or runs, such as Chromium, FFmpeg, PulseAudio, Wine, cloudflared
    and Tailscale;
  - AI models you download to use with the software.


6. If you break this license

If you break any of these terms, your rights under this license end.
If it is the first time, and you stop within 30 days of the licensor
telling you about it, your rights come back as if they had never
ended.


